Environment RescueZone
  that perceives signal, obstacle, survivor
  with actions
    clear_path that removes obstacle.
    deploy_beacon that creates signal.
    move that changes survivor.

Agent Coordinator
  believes mission_status is active
  believes sector
  desires to rescue
  using channel Radio
  in environment RescueZone
  focusing on signal, survivor
  ignoring obstacle
  with plans
    start_rescue when achieve rescue then
      send everyone achieve patrol via Radio.
    survivor_found when believes survivor then
      send everyone tell abort via Radio.
    handle_emergency when loses belief mission_status then
      send everyone tell abort via Radio.

create 3 Drone agents
  believes battery is 100
  using channel Radio
  in environment RescueZone
  with plans
    search when achieve patrol then
      ask Coordinator about sector and wait via Radio,
      achieve scan.
    do_scan when achieve scan then
      send Coordinator tell survivor via Radio.
